    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The final episode of the series.</strong> While Ep. 1 and 2 contained an introduction and rising action, this final installment has the highest point of tension in the storyline, where the MC faces the truth and makes an important choice (building a harem around his landlady, her daughters, and female neighbors).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being falsely accused by a girl named Julie, the main character narrowly avoids prison thanks to his influential father, who sends him to live abroad with an ex-girlfriend to keep him out of trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now living in a cramped apartment with his landlady Lidia and her two daughters\u2014Nastya and Olga\u2014the MC finds himself surrounded by broken relationships. Nastya is stuck with a drug addict, Olga\u2019s with a wannabe gangster. Both are unhappy, and both are vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using his intelligence, charm, and manipulation, the MC slowly inserts himself into their lives, pulling them away from their boyfriends and toward him. All of this happens under the nose of their mother, Lidia\u2014lonely, alcoholic, and emotionally unstable. She doesn\u2019t find him attractive, so he creates a masked persona to seduce her in secret. It works. She falls in love with the fake version of him and, not knowing who he really is, even wants to share him with her daughters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, the MC starts to realize that everyone around him is hiding something, wearing masks just like he is. Julie is still blackmailing him from afar, and people who seem innocent aren\u2019t always what they appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, he tries to have a normal relationship with a kind, religious neighbor named Dilara. But things spiral again when her lonely mother, Faiza, betrays her daughter and makes a move on the MC\u2014behind her husband\u2019s back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Masks of Deceit</strong> is a dark, story-driven game about manipulation, power, and human weakness. It\u2019s not about saving the world or being a hero. It\u2019s about how far you\u2019ll go when you\u2019re cornered\u2014and what kind of person you become when you realize no one\u2019s really innocent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More details will be added as the development progresses.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/c6e25655f98c791039ce44a0e6b94057.webp?t=1752780093\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive 3D atmosphere </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lively backgrounds and characters (aniamted, blinking etc.) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classically animated adult scenes with life imitating realism </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutscenes and fully animated adult scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy focus on character manipulation and social influence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and choices that impact relationships and outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple storylines and hidden consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No heroes. Just people using each other to survive </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Animations sample</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seducing the landlady disguised as a priest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/05a56d4277c9a12fd35f460ff8e8b17e.poster.avif?t=1752780093\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/05a56d4277c9a12fd35f460ff8e8b17e.webm?t=1752780093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/05a56d4277c9a12fd35f460ff8e8b17e.mp4?t=1752780093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seducing the mom of Igor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/b42e24287deccf3a767df8bcdddbd02a.poster.avif?t=1752780093\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/b42e24287deccf3a767df8bcdddbd02a.webm?t=1752780093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/b42e24287deccf3a767df8bcdddbd02a.mp4?t=1752780093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/13071cf2fd75e7b51c0d2f26ca2efc91.webp?t=1752780093\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milfvania tells the story of a young guy who got into trouble because of a girl (Julie) recruited for an amateur porn video. As a result, his father tells him it's better to move abroad. he had to move abroad, somewhere in post-Soviet Europe. There he met his landlady (Lidia) and her two daughters. But soon after, Julie follows him, and all the wicked and devilish things she does will turn out for the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Episodes can be played in any order, as they each encapsulate fantasies on their own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The milfs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520110/extras/048f581ae447ba5ff35c9788092ba7e6.avif?t=175278