:</strong> Yes, way longer. I took notice of your complaints and I will deliver all the story inside Ep. 3.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong>Any new mechanics? <strong>A:</strong> Yes, I'm currently developing a technique to make the animated scenes more interactive and easier to switch between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:</strong>Any news in terms of animations? <strong>A:</strong> Yes, I plan to make the scenes fully animated.</p></li></ul>",
